        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-7" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Description for&amp;nbsp;Game progres:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;message spoilers-container&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Group of 2 classes. class allbots creates 1 player and &amp;lt;23 bots. class &lt;br&gt;oneone creates &amp;lt;24 players. Each bot and player is individually given&lt;br&gt; a name. also, you can choose a game with characters, in which case each player can become a character.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-595" y="700" width="570" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-10" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#660000,#660000);strokeColor=none;opacity=60;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="950" width="590" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-11" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Description for&amp;nbsp;Game progres:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;message spoilers-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;A group of classes inherited from the player. Each has its own unique &lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;ability (action) that changes the course of the game. Each class also &lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;has a field for interaction with the player (contact)&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="95" y="960" width="570" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-12" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#B1DDF0,#173D4D);strokeColor=none;opacity=70;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1140" y="387" width="590" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-13" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Description for characters:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;message spoilers-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;A group of 6 classes inherited from the player. Each has its own unique &lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;ability (action) that changes the course of the game. Each class also &lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;has a field for interaction with the player (contact)&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1155" y="397" width="570" height="123" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-14" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#CCE5FF,#182E44);strokeColor=none;opacity=80;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1410" y="-855" width="620" height="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-15" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Description for bot:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;message spoilers-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;group of classes from 2 classes. the game class is responsible for the course of the game: creating bots, characters, players, choosing the &lt;br&gt;difficulty, setting the bet, etc. The startgame method starts the entire&lt;br&gt; program. The timer class is optional, thanks to it you can limit the &lt;br&gt;time of actions, the time of decision-making, the time of the game &lt;br&gt;itself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1439" y="-845" width="570" height="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-16" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#BAC8D3,#39454E);strokeColor=none;opacity=80;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1000" y="-864" width="350" height="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4VDO7HAGhQBo2CYRpYJk-17" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Description for Base Rule:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;message spoilers-container&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;a group of 8 classes. All of them define the basic elements and rules of&lt;br/&gt; the game, constitute the main functionality. The Card class creates 1 &lt;br/&gt;card with a suit and rank, the Deck class creates 52 cards, the Hand &lt;br/&gt;class is part of the Player class, contains cards. Thanks to the Hand, &lt;br/&gt;the Player can manage his cards. The Player is the basic character at &lt;br/&gt;the table, for whom you can play. The Dealer class contains the main &lt;br/&gt;deck, deals and takes cards, checks the strength of the hand and &lt;br/&gt;identifies the winner. The Bank class contains information about the &lt;br/&gt;current bet and the total bank that the winner will receive. The &lt;br/&gt;ContactSiger class receives the player&#39;s response, checks it, and also &lt;br/&gt;determines if the player wants to run the Rules. The Rules class &lt;br/&gt;contains all the rules about the game, they can be run at any time &lt;br/&gt;during the game.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-980" y="-854" width="315" height="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
